 * left cell bitmap, columns 8-15 the right cell bitmap, scored together as
 * one 128-bit pair (WideSymbolDef). The bitmaps are chafa's own, a close
 * match to a Japanese terminal font (chafa-symbols-kana.h header).
 *
 * Unlike the narrow tables this tier is engine-coupled: chafa's
 * init_symbol_array_wide() (chafa-symbols.c) puts these glyphs in its wide
 * symbols2 array — never the narrow symbol array — and the wide machinery
